  "titleEn": "Learning to Cook",
  "titleEs": "Aprender a cocinar",
  "titleText": {
    "es": "Y sin embargo nunca dejo de pensar: ",
    "en": "And yet I never stop thinking, 'sure, these ingredients cost more than a restaurant meal, but think how many meals I'll get out of them! Especially since each one will have leftovers!'",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish field intentionally preserves the archive's truncated title text and its trailing space after the colon; the English field preserves the complete official title text. The raster is a flowchart: arrows, node borders, and the crossing that OCR rendered as a plus sign are structural artwork, not printed lexical units. OCR's OBRAS and E are corrected to the visible SOBRAS and EL."
  },
