        "A2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "word-sabe--tastes",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "sabe",
      "answerEn": "tastes; has a flavor",
      "noteEn": "When food or drink is the subject, saber describes its taste. Sabe is the present form for one thing; this is different from sabe meaning “knows.”",
      "example": {
        "es": "La sopa sabe bien.",
        "en": "The soup tastes good."
      },
      "tags": [
